 submitted payouts expressed in the currency’s minor units (e.g. cents, pence).\",\"format\":\"int64\",\"readOnly\":true,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"summary\":{\"description\":\"Gets a summary of the payments account's most important properties.\",\"nullable\":true,\"readOnly\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"supplierSepaInstantStatus\":{\"description\":\"Indicates the status of the SEPA Instant payment rail for this account.\",\"enum\":[\"None\",\"Pending\",\"InProgress\",\"Enabled\",\"Disabled\",\"Failed\"],\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroBankFeedConnectionStatus\":{\"description\":\"States the status of the Xero bank feed connection, if applicable.\",\"enum\":[\"None\",\"Pending\",\"Active\",\"Inactive\",\"Failed\"],\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroBankFeedLastSyncedAt\":{\"format\":\"date-time\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroBankFeedSyncLastFailedAt\":{\"format\":\"date-time\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroBankFeedSyncLastFailureReason\":{\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroBankFeedSyncStatus\":{\"enum\":[\"None\",\"InProgress\",\"Completed\",\"Failed\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"xeroUnsynchronisedTransactionsCount\":{\"description\":\"Indicates the number of unsynchronised transactions with Xero\",\"format\":\"int32\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"array\"},\"theirReference\":{\"description\":\"The reference that will be used by default as TheirReference when creating payouts to this beneficiary\\r\\nif no TheirReference is specified for the payout.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"currency\",\"name\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}},\"description\":\"OK\"},\"201\":{\"description\":\"The newly created beneficiary.\"},\"409\":{\"description\":\"Beneficiary already exists for this merchant.\"}},\"security\":[{\"Bearer\":[]}],\"securitySchemes\":{\"Bearer\":{\"description\":\"JWT Authorization header using the Bearer scheme.<br/>\\r\\n  